# Private repositories to clone on a new machine.
#
# Format, one per line:
#   owner/repo [destination]
#
# destination is optional and defaults to ~/Code/<repo>.
#
# These are cloned over SSH, so `dot repos clone` refuses to run until the
# machine's key is registered with GitHub — it checks, rather than failing
# halfway through with a permission-denied for each repo. `dot init` runs it
# after gen-ssh-key for that reason.
#
# Already-cloned repos are left completely alone: never pulled, never reset.

